WEBVTT

00:23:57.829 --> 00:24:01.788
We teach you how to fail and get
back up when you are brand new

00:24:01.788 --> 00:24:07.496
and weak one like we normalize discomfort
because I just can't have people working

00:24:07.496 --> 00:24:11.121
for me who are only doing what they're
already good at doing.

00:24:11.163 --> 00:24:14.329
I just that's not that's not effective.
Like, that's not innovative.

00:24:14.663 --> 00:24:20.788
So for me, it just means like, I will
definitely have people who are two levels,

00:24:20.788 --> 00:24:22.913
you know, apart from me, who, you know,

00:24:22.913 --> 00:24:26.079
their bosses boss report to me and
they will say to me, hey, Brian,

00:24:26.079 --> 00:24:28.079
can I rumble with you on the
social media strategy?

00:24:28.079 --> 00:24:30.746
I am not I'm not down with
it yet. I don't get it.